{'symbol': 'AXP', 'date': '2023-06-27 07:30:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN EXPRESS ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT OF CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER JEFFREY C. CAMPBELL AND NAMES DEPUTY CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER CHRISTOPHE LE CAILLEC AS SUCCESSOR', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY (NYSE:AXP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT JEFFREY C. CAMPBELL, VICE CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, HAS DECIDED TO RETIRE FROM THE COMPANY. HE WILL STEP DOWN AS THE COMPANY'S CFO AS OF AUGUST 14, 2023, AT WHICH TIME CHRISTOPHE LE CAILLEC, DEPUTY CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL SUCCEED HIM AS CFO, AND JOIN THE AMERICAN EXPRESS EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE. MR. CAMPBELL WILL REMAIN WITH AMERICAN EXPRESS AS VICE CHAIRMAN UNTIL MARCH 2024. “ON BEHALF OF THE BOAR."}